{"4967040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Province: Suroste", "steam_appid": 4967040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5167190], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A handcrafted retro RPG built from scratch.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Return home after ten years of civil war only to discover that your closest friend has been murdered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Begin your own investigation and gradually uncover a much larger mystery hidden within the province.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967040/extras/c77315ef202c19422deb19b140b897d9.poster.avif?t=1787943478\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967040/extras/c77315ef202c19422deb19b140b897d9.webm?t=1787943478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967040/extras/c77315ef202c19422deb19b140b897d9.mp4?t=1787943478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Wander through villages, forests, forgotten ruins, and dangerous dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover hidden locations, read books, speak with locals and travelers, and uncover the history of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967040/extras/d04e97f41e2ec35151f3b7a06b6f0f97.poster.avif?t=1787943478\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967040/extras/d04e97f41e2ec35151f3b7a06b6f0f97.webm?t=1787943478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967040/extras/d04e97f41e2ec35151f3b7a06b6f0f97.mp4?t=1787943478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Face bandits, monsters, and other dangers in real-time combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use swords, bows, shields, scrolls, and a variety of equipment to fight in your own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967040/extras/fe2f886cea3caa1d52f6ae713cd69a4a.poster.avif?t=1787943478\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967040/extras/fe2f886cea3caa1d52f6ae713cd69a4a.webm?t=1787943478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967040/extras/fe2f886cea3caa1d52f6ae713cd69a4a.mp4?t=1787943478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Live in the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Trade with merchants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Visit taverns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Help the locals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find weapons and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore the world at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Go wherever curiosity leads you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"http